// The output is a flat string map; nested objects (`dj`, `radio_mode`,
// `text_channels`, `voice_channels`, the v5 `commands_global` object and
// `commands` map, array fields) are JSON-encoded once so the wire format is
// interchangeable with the Node `redisAdapter.cache.db.module.setModule`
// (whose `serializeValue` JSON.stringifies objects/maps field-for-field).
